</head>
<body class="gradient-bg text-slate-100 min-h-screen font-sans">

    <header class="border-b border-slate-800 py-6 px-4 md:px-8">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-center gap-4">
            <div>
                <span class="bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/20 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
                    SFM: Sustainable Food Security (Malaysia)
                </span>
                <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mt-2 text-white">
                    Bio-Calculus & Aquaculture Optimization
                </h1>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-1">
                    Applying Derivatives $f'(x)$ to model Nile Tilapia (<span class="italic">Oreochromis niloticus</span>) growth rates in intensive Malaysian aquaculture systems.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-2">
                <a href="#problem-statement" class="text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg transition">Read Bio-Context</a>
